  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 204.14 Discovery and Disclosure. Upon the written request of a party, the department shall disclose any information, not privileged, in the possession of the department, which is the subject matter of the proceeding.\n\nSource. #6299, eff 7-25-96, EXPIRED: 7-25-04\n\nNew. #8309-A, eff 3-24-05",
